---

This project does not redistribute machine-learning models. Scripts/fetch-models.sh
downloads them at setup time:

  • MobileCLIP Core ML encoders — apple/coreml-mobileclip, Apple ASCL licence
  • CLIP vocabulary and merges  — openai/clip-vit-base-patch32, MIT licence

Speech recognition uses the model macOS installs and manages itself; nothing is
bundled or redistributed for it.
